      ],
      "source": "https://sbhistoryblog.wordpress.com/2026/01/01/the-del-aire-area-remains-unincorporated-despite-decades-of-annexation-attempts/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hawthorne has made multiple moves to annex Del Aire, beginning a decades‑long tug‑of‑war over the neighborhood.",
